Potential issue: If demand 2 previous, lag valid, no rise, no lead change, but rotated true and lead hours > min by >50 causing lead change to min. Then leadPump <> prevLead true, so lag reselected excluding new lead. Good. The property S8 demands that. Could there be situation where lead changes to min and the old lead was the previous lag? Since old lag might become lead? Wait lead change to minimum pump; minimum could be old lag. Then new lead is old lag, and we need choose lag from remaining excluding new lead; old lead now becomes maybe not lead, but might be lag. Our minPumpExcluding will select from five excluding new lead. That includes old lead. Good.

